<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: white;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .ticket-info {
        background: #f0f0f0;
        border-radius: 5px;
        padding: 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
      }
      .info-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin: 10px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .label {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #7f8c8d;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #667eea;
        color: white;
        padding: 12px 30px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #ecf0f1;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #7f8c8d;
        border-top: 1px solid #bdc3c7;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 4px 10px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 5px 5px 5px 0;
      }
      .badge-high {
        background: #ff6b6b;
        color: white;
      }
      .badge-medium {
        background: #ffd93d;
        color: #333;
      }
      .badge-low {
        background: #6bcf7f;
        color: white;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h2>🎫 Support Ticket Created</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= @requester_name %></strong>,</p>

        <p>Thank you for contacting our support team. We've received your support ticket and our team is already looking into it.</p>

        <div class="ticket-info">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="label">Ticket Number:</span>
            <span><strong><%= @ticket.ticket_number %></strong></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="label">Subject:</span>
            <span><%= @ticket.subject %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="label">Category:</span>
            <span><%= @ticket.category_display %></span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="label">Priority:</span>
            <span>
              <span class="badge" style="background: <%= case @ticket.priority when 'urgent' then '#ff6b6b' when 'high' then '#ffd93d' else '#6bcf7f' end %>; color: <%= @ticket.priority == 'high' ? '#333' : 'white' %>;">
                <%= @ticket.priority.upcase %>
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="label">Status:</span>
            <span>
              <span class="badge" style="background: #667eea; color: white;">
                <%= @ticket.status.upcase %>
              </span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Your Message:</strong></p>
        <div style="background: #f9f9f9; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; border-left: 3px solid #667eea;">
          <%= simple_format(@ticket.description) %>
        </div>

        <h3>What happens next?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Our support team will review your ticket within 24 hours</li>
          <li>You'll receive email updates whenever there's activity on your ticket</li>
          <li>You can check the status anytime using your ticket number</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/support/tickets/<%= @ticket.ticket_number %>" class="cta-button">
            View Your Ticket
          </a>
        </p>

        <p>If you have any questions in the meantime, feel free to reply to this email or contact us at support@salespoints.com</p>

        <p>Thank you for choosing SalesPoints!<br>
        <strong>SalesPoints Support Team</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p style="margin: 0;">© <%= Date.today.year %> SalesPoints. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;">Ticket ID: <%= @ticket.id %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
